{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Weg naar de WIA 2007-2009"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:39121"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Onderzoeksbureau APE; Onderzoeksbureau Astri"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"C  Schrijvershof"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"APE"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>\"De weg naar de WIA\" is een omvangrijk onderzoek dat is uitgevoerd door de onderzoeksbureaus APE en Astri. In dit onderzoek zijn ruim 4.000 werknemers en ruim 1.500 \"vangnetters\" die op 1 oktober 2007 (circa) negen maanden waren ziek gemeld, anderhalf jaar gevolgd. Dat gebeurde door het enquêteren van deze werknemers c.q. vangnetters omstreeks 10, 18 en 27 maanden na de aanvankelijke ziekmelding. Daarnaast zijn werkgevers van langdurig zieke werknemers tweemaal geënquêteerd. Eerst zijn de werkgevers van de 4.019 deelnemers aan de eerste meting benaderd met vragen over hun verzuim- en re-integratiebeleid. Bij de derde meting is aan de werknemers toestemming gevraagd de werkgever te benaderen met vragen over de begeleiding van langdurig zieke werknemers, waaronder de betreffende respondent.<br>Het onderzoek is mogelijk gemaakt door Stichting Instituut GAK.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Medicine, Health and Life Sciences","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"WIA"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"social security"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"return to work"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"disability"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Wet Werk en Inkomen naar Arbeidsvermogen (WIA)"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"sociale zekerheid"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"arbeidsparticipatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"ziekteverzuim"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"reintegratie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"arbeidsongeschiktheid"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2007-11-01"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"drs. C.L. (Cathelijne) van der Burg (Astri)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"drs. P.G.M